{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Un14T1HPCJWaMwo3JuXEUX","type":"tool_result","content":"# kubectl rollout Command Reference\n\n## Synopsis / Description\n\n**kubectl rollout** — \"Manage the rollout of a resource\"\n\n\"Manage the rollout of one or many resources.\n\nValid resource types include:\n\n*   deployments\n*   daemonsets\n*   statefulsets\"\n\n## Available Subcommands\n\n1. **kubectl rollout history** — \"View rollout history\"\n\n2. **kubectl rollout pause** — \"Mark the provided resource as paused\"\n\n3. **kubectl rollout restart** — \"Restart a resource\"\n\n4. **kubectl rollout resume** — \"Resume a paused resource\"\n\n5. **kubectl rollout status** — \"Show the status of the rollout\"\n\n6. **kubectl rollout undo** — \"Undo a previous rollout\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b489fccf-1e67-4e89-a205-d6eb19382b09","uuid":"8339905a-4794-4ec1-b263-a087def252dd","timestamp":"2026-08-24T11:57:07.762Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":491239,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# kubectl rollout Command Reference\n\n## Synopsis / Description\n\n**kubectl rollout** — \"Manage the rollout of a resource\"\n\n\"Manage the rollout of one or many resources.\n\nValid resource types include:\n\n*   deployments\n*   daemonsets\n*   statefulsets\"\n\n## Available Subcommands\n\n1. **kubectl rollout history** — \"View rollout history\"\n\n2. **kubectl rollout pause** — \"Mark the provided resource as paused\"\n\n3. **kubectl rollout restart** — \"Restart a resource\"\n\n4. **kubectl rollout resume** — \"Resume a paused resource\"\n\n5. **kubectl rollout status** — \"Show the status of the rollout\"\n\n6. **kubectl rollout undo** — \"Undo a previous rollout\"","durationMs":2669,"url":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/generated/kubectl_rollout/"}}
